     "Your Logical Fallacy Is", "Critical Thinking"),
    ("Appeal to Authority", "https://yourlogicalfallacyis.com/appeal-to-authority",
     "Explore the difference between trusting relevant expertise and treating someone's status as unquestionable proof.",
     "Your Logical Fallacy Is", "Media Literacy"),
    ("Probability: Likely Does Not Mean Certain",
     "https://seeing-theory.brown.edu/basic-probability/index.html",
     "Explain probability using coins, dice, and everyday predictions. Why can a 90 percent chance still fail to happen?",
     "Seeing Theory", "Probability & Statistics"),
    ("How Premises Support a Conclusion",
