     "Cambridge in Colour", "Optics & Photography"),
    ("Learning by Building Small Projects",
     "https://www.instructables.com/",
     "Show how to turn a practical question into a small experiment, test an idea, and learn from failure.",
     "Instructables", "Making & Experiments"),
